1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,851
As Uke comes to strike 
the side of the head with the knife

2
00:00:02,852 --> 00:00:04,654
enter deeply to control the strike

3
00:00:04,655 --> 00:00:09,213
take control of his wrist and elbow 
turning the hips sharply stretching his arm out,

4
00:00:09,214 --> 00:00:11,525
as you do so and Uke´s balance comes forward,

5
00:00:11,526 --> 00:00:13,659
maintain control of the wrist and elbow,

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,890
applying slight pressure to his elbow,

7
00:00:16,591 --> 00:00:18,089
as you place the arm down

8
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:22,180
raise his elbow up 
pushing his wrist underneath so is 90 degrees,

9
00:00:22,181 --> 00:00:25,152
push down on the elbow until he releases the knife.

